    This file is NEVER loaded at runtime: FitShareApp locks the app to Hebrew with
    setApplicationLocales("he"), per SPEC section 9.2. It is kept deliberately, to show that
    no user-facing text is hardcoded and that the app is translation-ready. Keep it in sync
    with values/strings.xml. Explained in the README so it is not mistaken for dead code.
-->
